# Umrah Connect — environment templates live next to each app:
#   platform/api/.env.example                    API (local development)
#   apps/web/.env.local.example                  Web (Next.js)
#   infrastructure/kvm/.env.production.example   API on Hostinger KVM 8 (production)
#
# Integrations that are NOT implemented read no variables and are intentionally not listed here
# (SMS/WhatsApp, regulator APIs, ZATCA, BNPL gateways, monitoring vendors).
# The root docker-compose.yml is a development-only stack and needs no variables.
